meta {
  name: Notifications - List
  type: http
  seq: 147
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/notifications?limit=20&offset=0&community=nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w&older=false
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The "Needs you" notifications of the current member, in every community (#1474, ADR 0042): a reply to your post, a reply to your comment, a mention. The newest news first, 20 per page, offset pagination (ADR 0011). Each one holds the community, the space, the last author (null for a deleted member), up to 3 authors with others_count, a plain text excerpt of 300 characters at most and the title of the post, built from the live content, and the target to open (post_slug, comment_cuid, chat_message_cuid). community keeps one community (cuid). older=true lists the notifications that are older than 14 days. Needs notifications:read (not in the default set of a token).
}
